<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ElasWave</span>: An Elastic-Native System for Scalable Hybrid-Parallel Training</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_submissionid">&lt;610&gt;</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
